s of forbes thinks he's a  perfect choice perhaps it's the product  of typecasting but it's difficult to  imagine krazynski is superman hughes  comparison of krazynski's character on  the office to clark kent is more than  apt  and that's the problem it isn't  difficult at all to see krazynski as  kent  but it feels almost impossible to see  him portraying the other half of that  iconic duality  his work in a quiet place and jack ryan  notwithstanding  krzezinski seems like the guy who plays  the one who's being saved  not the one who's doing the saving best  michael b jordan it didn't take long at  all for reports to surface that warner  brothers already had a front-runner to  replace cavill as superman  and if it pans out it would arguably be  the most non-traditional and bold  superman casting choice to date  black panther's michael b jordan  continuously proving himself to be a  stellar actor with huge range  jordan's one of the premier reasons  black panther is an oscar contender  and as anyone who's had to hear their  partner talk about jordan going  shirtless can attest  we know he's got the physique worst  dwayne johnson  the rock's name is popping up as a  potential candidate for obvious reasons  he sells tickets he's got the body for  it and as usa today said  he is superman after all however dwayne  johnson's commitments to play the  anti-hero black adam would make playing  superman in the same narrative difficult  and while superman is big muscular and  larger than life just like johnson  he's also extremely humble and johnson  just may not be that guy  in fact if warner brothers decided to go  in a different physical direction for  superman's classic nemesis  johnson could make a great lex luthor he  already has the hairdo  best colin o'donoghue according to the  hollywood reporters blog heat vision  once upon a times colin o'donoghue was  one of the actors competing with cavill  for the role of superman  in 2013's man of steel the irish post  reported 